<Document>
<name>Monterey Bay chip-bed spots</name>
<description>Psilocybe records and likely wood-chip beds around Monterey Bay. Exported Nov 19, 2026. Nothing here was checked on the ground.</description>
<Style id="tK"><IconStyle><scale>1.1</scale><Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/red-stars.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style>
<Style id="tP"><IconStyle><scale>1.1</scale><Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/purple-circle.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style>
