<Placemark><name>Harvey West, Pioneer St</name><styleUrl>#tC</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Candidate site</b> · Santa Cruz<br><br>Harvey West business area, 400 m from the River St Psilocybe record.<br><br>4 wood-chip fungus records within 200 m (Jan 2024 to Apr 2025): mulch maid ×2, red spy ×1, A. putaminum ×1.<br><br>Access: Business district. Stick to public frontage.<br><br><a href="https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/260026625">Indicator record</a><br><br><a href="https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/269379885">Indicator record</a><br><br>36.98751, -122.03361]]></description><Point><coordinates>-122.033610,36.987510,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
