<Placemark><name>Natural Bridges and Delaware Ave west</name><styleUrl>#tC</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Candidate site</b> · Santa Cruz<br><br>One record is noted as clusters in woodchips, at the park entrance and along Delaware Ave.<br><br>16 wood-chip fungus records within 330 m (Jan 2018 to Feb 2026): mulch maid ×11, red spy ×5.<br><br>Deadly galerina recorded within 330 m (Mar 2024).<br><br>Access: State park. Look, don't collect.<br><br><a href="https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/327960880">Indicator record</a><br><br><a href="https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/146062835">Indicator record</a><br><br>36.95393, -122.05730]]></description><Point><coordinates>-122.057300,36.953930,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
